♪ I'll be waiting by the shore ♪

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
♪♪

10
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:34,500
MAN [on radio]: All units,
respond to <i>Pier 14</i>.

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
...

12
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:40,000
<i>- Is he gone?</i>
<i>- For now.</i>

13
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,500
